            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many years later, when Artaxerxes was emperor of Persia, there was a man named Ezra. He traced his ancestors back to Aaron, the High Priest, as follows: Ezra was the son of Seraiah, son of Azariah, son of Hilkiah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Shallum, son of Zadok, son of Ahitub, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Amariah, son of Azariah, son of Meraioth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Zerahiah, son of Uzzi, son of Bukki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
