            "sid": "EZR 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezra was a scholar with a thorough knowledge of the Law which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.6+EZR.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.6",
              "EZR.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, had given to Moses. Because Ezra had the blessing of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.6+EZR.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.6",
              "EZR.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " his God, the emperor gave him everything he asked for. In the seventh year of the reign of Artaxerxes, Ezra set out from Babylonia for Jerusalem with a group of Israelites which included priests, Levites, temple musicians, temple guards, and workmen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.6+EZR.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.6",
              "EZR.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They left Babylonia on the first day of the first month, and with God's help they arrived in Jerusalem on the first day of the fifth month. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.8+EZR.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.8",
              "EZR.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezra had devoted his life to studying the Law of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to practising it, and to teaching all its laws and regulations to the people of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
