              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezra said, “Praise the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of our ancestors! He has made the emperor willing to honour in this way the Temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By God's grace I have won the favour of the emperor, of his counsellors, and of all his powerful officials; the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " my God has given me courage, and I have been able to persuade many of the heads of the clans of Israel to return with me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
